### Render Template with Strict Mode and Environment Variables

Source: https://github.com/mitsuhiko/minijinja/blob/main/minijinja-cli/src/long_help.txt

Renders a template file with strict mode enabled, potentially using environment variables for configuration.

```bash
minijinja-cli --strict --env hello.j2
```

